========================================================================================
                      CLASS 10 MATHEMATICS FORMULA CHEATSHEET
========================================================================================

1. REAL NUMBERS & POLYNOMIALS
─────────────────────────────
• HCF(a,b) × LCM(a,b) = a × b
• Quadratic Polynomial: P(x) = ax² + bx + c
  - Sum of Zeros  (α + β) = -b/a
  - Product Zeros (α · β) =  c/a
  - Form equation: k[x² - (Sum)x + Product]

2. PAIR OF LINEAR EQUATIONS
───────────────────────────
• System: a₁x + b₁y + c₁ = 0  &  a₂x + b₂y + c₂ = 0
  - Unique Solution  : a₁/a₂ ≠ b₁/b₂            (Intersecting)
  - Infinite Solutions: a₁/a₂ = b₁/b₂ = c₁/c₂     (Coincident)
  - No Solution       : a₁/a₂ = b₁/b₂ ≠ c₁/c₂     (Parallel)

3. QUADRATIC EQUATIONS
──────────────────────
• ax² + bx + c = 0
• Quadratic Formula : x = [-b ± √(b² - 4ac)] / 2a
• Discriminant (D)  : D = b² - 4ac
  - D > 0 : 2 Real & Distinct Roots
  - D = 0 : 2 Real & Equal Roots (-b/2a)
  - D < 0 : No Real Roots

4. ARITHMETIC PROGRESSION (AP)
──────────────────────────────
• n-th Term (aₙ)    : aₙ = a + (n - 1)d
• Sum of n terms    : Sₙ = (n/2) × [2a + (n - 1)d]
• Alternative Sum   : Sₙ = (n/2) × (a + l)       [l = last term]

5. COORDINATE GEOMETRY
──────────────────────
• Distance Formula  : d = √[(x₂ - x₁)² + (y₂ - y₁)²]
• Section Formula   : P(x,y) = ( (m₁x₂ + m₂x₁)/(m₁+m₂) , (m₁y₂ + m₂y₁)/(m₁+m₂) )
• Midpoint Formula  : M(x,y) = ( (x₁ + x₂)/2 , (y₁ + y₂)/2 )

6. TRIGONOMETRY
───────────────
• Ratios            : sinθ = P/H | cosθ = B/H | tanθ = P/B
• Identities        : ① sin²θ + cos²θ = 1
                      ② 1 + tan²θ = sec²θ
                      ③ 1 + cot²θ = cosec²θ
• Key Values        :
  - sin(30°) = 1/2   | sin(45°) = 1/√2 | sin(60°) = √3/2
  - cos(30°) = √3/2  | cos(45°) = 1/√2 | cos(60°) = 1/2
  - tan(30°) = 1/√3  | tan(45°) = 1    | tan(60°) = √3

7. MENSURATION (SURFACE AREA & VOLUME)
──────────────────────────────────────
• Cone              : CSA = πrl | TSA = πr(l + r) | Vol = (1/3)πr²h | l = √(r²+h²)
• Sphere            : SA  = 4πr² | Vol = (4/3)πr³
• Hemisphere        : CSA = 2πr² | TSA = 3πr²     | Vol = (2/3)πr³

8. STATISTICS & PROBABILITY
───────────────────────────
• Empirical Relation: Mode = 3(Median) - 2(Mean)
• Probability P(E)  : (Favorable Outcomes) / (Total Outcomes)
• Complementary     : P(E) + P(NOT E) = 1

